  "shortDescription": "CallHippo is an SMB-focused cloud phone system sold as two ladders: an Office Phone System (Basic, Starter, Professional, Ultimate) for day-to-day business calling and a scaled call-centre ladder (Bronze, Silver, Platinum) for high-volume teams. Entry pricing is materially lower than Aircall with only a 2-user minimum on Starter, but call recording, multilingual IVR and CRM integrations start on Professional, and AI is a paid Copilot add-on.",
